# Tech steering (node)

Stack, tooling, and commands agents should prefer.

## Detected stacks

| Ecosystem | Confidence | Signals | Version | Package manager |
|-----------|------------|---------|---------|-----------------|
| node | high | package.json, package-lock.json | >=20 | npm |

- Node: prefer `npm` scripts (`npm run build`, `npm test`) unless the
  lockfile names another manager.
